     * as lowercase hex. This is the value the owner must bind as the agent's
     * `silent_key` when enrolling this pocket (`add_agent` on the mobile
     * authorizer): the guard's silent-refill check rejects any refill whose
     * signer is not the registered silent key. `None` on surfaces without a
     * hardware signer (test doubles).
     */
    public var silentKeyHex: String?
